      {
        "day": 79,
        "vid": "caleb_jones",
        "kcal": 1328,
        "line": "🍽️ Thin day. Your bowl stays half-full — the other half goes to Caleb, who's been quiet about being hungry."
      },
      {
        "day": 80,
        "vid": "caleb_jones",
        "kcal": 1221,
        "line": "🍽️ You push half your bowl across the fire to Caleb — 'eat. You need it more than I do.' Caleb doesn't argue. The bowl comes back scraped clean."
      },
      {
        "day": 81,
        "vid": "hassan_ali",
        "kcal": 1198,
        "line": "🍽️ The bins are thin, and Hassan looks it. You set your second half in front of Hassan. 'Eat,' you say. Hassan eats like someone making up for days."
